  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Gajanan Haridas Pawar vs The State Of Maharashtra on 3 October, 2023 Author: N. J. Jamadar Bench: N. J. Jamadar 18-Aba2738-2023.Doc Santosh In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No. 2738 Of 2023 Gajanan Haridas Pawar ...Applicant Versus The State of Maharashtra ...Respondent Mr. Umesh Pawar, for the Applicant. Mr. M. G. Patil, App for the State/Respondent. Phc S.D. Patil, Shahupuri Police Station, Kolhapur, present. Coram: N. J. Jamadar, J. Dated: 3rd October, 2023 Order:",
    "facts": "2. This is an application for pre-arrest bail in connection with CR No.848 of 2023, registered with Shahupuri Police Station, Kolhapur, for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 272, 273 and 338 of Indian Penal Code, 1860 (\"the Penal Code\") and Section 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 3. Co-accused Sheshkumar Mangal Singh was found transporting contraband article - gutkha pan-masala. It transpired that co-accused Sheshkkumar was transporting contraband articles for and on behalf of the applicant. Evidently the applicant is roped in on the basis of the statement of the co-accused. The applicant was not found in possession of or transporting the contraband articles.",
